  ✓ not the safety hand-off
  ✓ final text passes guard (0 residual)
--- reply ---
I'm sorry to hear you're struggling with insomnia — that kind of exhaustion wears deeply on the body and spirit 🙏

Here's what Master Lu recommends for daily recitation:

📿 **Great Compassion Mantra** × 7 times
Prayer: *"May the Great Merciful and Great Compassionate Guan Yin Bodhisattva protect and bless me, [your full name], grant me good health and peaceful rest."*

📿 **Heart Sutra** × 7 times
Prayer: *"May the Great Merciful and Great Compassionate Guan Yin Bodhisattva protect and bless me, [your full name], grant me wisdom and peace of mind."*
⚠️ Do not recite after 10pm, or during thunderstorms/heavy rain

📿 **Eighty-Eight Buddhas Great Repentance** × 1–3 times (start with 1)
Prayer: *"May the Great Merciful and Great Compassionate Guan Yin Bodhisattva protect and bless me, [your full name], help me repent and eliminate karmic obstacles."*
⚠️ Do not recite after 10pm

📿 **Mantra to Untie Karmic Knots (Jie Jie Zhou)** × 21–49 times
*(Insomnia is often linked to karmic creditors — this mantra helps dissolve those ties)*

Recite consistently. Guan Yin Bodhisattva will help when the time is right 🙏

