It's hard when home doesn't feel peaceful 🙏

Here's a simple place to start:

**📿 Great Compassion Mantra — 3 times daily**
Before reciting, say: *"May the Greatly Merciful and Greatly Compassionate Guan Yin Bodhisattva protect and bless me, [your full name], with good health and strength."*

**📿 Heart Sutra — 3 times daily**
Before reciting, say: *"May the Greatly Merciful and Greatly Compassionate Guan Yin Bodhisattva protect and bless me, [your full name], grant me wisdom, a calm and clear mind, and relief from distress."*
⚠️ Do not recite after 10pm

**📿 Mantra to Untie Karmic Knots — 21 times daily**
Before reciting, say: *"May the Greatly Merciful and Greatly Compassionate Guan Yin Bodhisattva help me, [your full name], and [family member's name] dissolve our karmic conflicts."*

These three are your foundation. Master Lu teaches that family conflicts often carry roots from past-life karmic ties — the Mantra to Untie Karmic Knots works directly on dissolving that.

