═══ CHIP6-en My family member i — guard: stripped ═══
Q: My family member is ill, what should I recite for them?
Sources: Heart Dharma Intro (EN) | Heart Dharma Intro (EN) | Heart Dharma Intro (EN) · types: introduction,qa_metaphysics,qa_general
  ✓ non-trivial reply (≥120 chars)
  ✓ no blanket refusal tail
  ✓ scoped 没有写明遍数 line (info only)
  ✓ not the safety hand-off
  ✓ final text passes guard (0 residual)
--- reply ---
I'm so sorry to hear your family member is unwell 🙏

Here's what Master Lu teaches for reciting on behalf of someone who is ill:

---

**For serious or critical illness — focus on the Great Compassion Mantra**

Master Lu's guidance from the Introduction Handbook and Q&A is clear: when someone is seriously ill, the priority is the **Great Compassion Mantra**.

Before reciting, say this prayer:

"May the Great Merciful and Great Compassionate Guan Yin Bodhisattva protect and bless [full name], please cure the illness on [part of body], and grant good health."

- **Great Compassion Mantra** — recite as much as possible, as often as possible. For critical condition: 49 times per day. Once condition stabilises, continue at 49 times per day.
- **Heart Sutra** — 49 times per day (especially helpful if the illness involves mental or emotional disturbance)
- **Eighty-Eight Buddhas Great Repentance** — 3 to 7 times per day, to help repent karmic obstacles

⚠️ Note: If the patient themselves is physically weak and reciting on their own, Master Lu teaches they should focus **only on the Great Compassion Mantra** — not the Heart Sutra or Amitabha Pure Land Rebirth Mantra, as these require more energy.

---

**If the family member is elderly or near end of life**

He also teaches:

> The body should not be touched or relocated within 8 hours after death, but you can quietly and peacefully perform recitations for the person.

---

**Little Houses (for karmic obstacles)**

If your family member's illness is severe and prolonged, Master Lu teaches that **Little Houses** addressed to their Karmic Creditors are very important — these help clear the spiritual root of the illness. Once your family member has started some recitation practice, you can begin reciting Little Houses addressed to "[their name]'s Karmic Creditor."

---

**If you are reciting in a hospital**

Master Lu's guidance (Q&A 125): If you are a caregiver at the hospital, you can recite any sutras and mantras **other than the Heart Sutra and the Amitabha Pure Land Rebirth Mantra** at the hospital. Recite the Great Compassion Mantra as much as possible to protect yourself too. You can track your counts during the day and mark the red dots on the Little House when you get home.

---

A few things that would help me give you more specific guidance:

- **Does your family member have any religious belief, or are they open to it?**
- **Are you reciting on their behalf, or are they reciting themselves?**
- **What kind of illness is it?** (e.g. physical illness, mental health, critical/terminal)

Guan Yin Bodhisattva is compassionate — your sincere recitation on their behalf truly helps 🙏

═══ CHIP1-id Saya sulit tidur,  — guard: clean ═══
Q: Saya sulit tidur, sutra apa yang harus saya baca?
Sources: Heart Dharma Intro (EN) | Heart Dharma Intro (EN) | Heart Dharma Intro (EN) · types: introduction
  ✓ non-trivial reply (≥120 chars)
  ✓ no blanket refusal tail
  ✓ scoped 没有写明遍数 line (info only)
  ✓ not the safety hand-off
  ✓ final text passes guard (0 residual)
--- reply ---
Sulit tidur itu memang melelahkan 🙏

Untuk membantu menenangkan pikiran dan tubuh, bisa mulai dengan:

📿 **《大悲咒》(Da Bei Zhou) setiap hari 3–7 kali**
Sebelum mulai, ucapkan:
*"请大慈大悲观世音菩萨保佑我（nama lengkap）身体健康，心情平静"*
("Mohon Bodhisattva Guan Yin Yang Maha Pengasih melindungi saya \[nama\], semoga badan sehat dan hati tenang")

📿 **《心经》(Xin Jing / Heart Sutra) setiap hari 3–7 kali**
Sebelum mulai, ucapkan:
*"请大慈大悲观世音菩萨保佑我（nama lengkap）开智慧，去除烦恼"*
("Mohon Bodhisattva Guan Yin memberi saya kebijaksanaan dan menghilangkan kegelisahan")

⚠️ **Catatan penting:** 《心经》sebaiknya **tidak dibaca setelah jam 10 malam**, terutama saat cuaca mendung atau hujan.

---

Kalau susah tidur karena pikiran yang tidak bisa berhenti, 《心经》 sangat membantu — karena fungsi utamanya membuka kebijaksanaan dan menghilangkan kegelisahan hati.

Kalau belum pernah hapal, ada video panduan cara membaca di sini:
🔗 https://xinlingfamen.info/jingwen/

Sebelum tidur, bisa juga pelan-pelan dalam hati ucapkan nama Bodhisattva: **南无大慈大悲观世音菩萨** — biarkan hati perlahan-lahan tenang 🙏

Kamu sebelumnya sudah pernah baca sutra atau ini pertama kali?

